      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "In the kitchen, Senya and Fedya are staging a ridiculous mock execution for a fish instead of preparing orders. Katya snaps at them to get back to work, and when Denis fusses over her with sweet pet names, she loses her patience with him too. Let's listen to the confrontation in Russian.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "katya",
      "t": "Может, мы уже работать начнём?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
